 "final_summary": "The root cause was a bug in password validation where `PASSWORD_MIN - 2` was used instead of `PASSWORD_MIN`, allowing passwords shorter than 8 characters to pass. The fix corrected the validation logic to require at least 8 characters, ensuring compliance with the API contract.",
